<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">EarthVerse: Benchmarking Scientific Agents Across
<br class="ltx_break">Dynamic Earth Systems and Natural Hazards</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:324.3pt;height:5.1pt;vertical-align:-1.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-116.8pt,1.9pt) scale(0.581317739756253,0.581317739756253) ;">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Zhiqing Cui   Xinxiang Yin   Yihong Tang   Xinglang Zhang   Yuanzhe Hu   Siru Zhong   Weidong Tang</span></span>
