</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:46.6pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Figure QA</span>
